# Seed tables, findings and archived reproducers are byte-compared across runs,
# and `core.autocrlf` is true on the machine this was built on.  Without this the
# first commit normalises them and the next Windows checkout materialises CRLF.
# Every sibling artefact directory in this repo pins the same thing.
* text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
